WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.160 --> 00:06.360
Get a doctor in here.

3
00:06.360 --> 00:08.560
I don't care if they give me drugs or electric shocks.

4
00:08.640 --> 00:10.680
Just make it all stop so I can finally rest.

5
00:10.840 --> 00:12.080
What's going on between you and Mr. Ing?

6
00:12.080 --> 00:12.960
Have you met him yet?

7
00:13.000 --> 00:15.040
Instead of wasting your time on me,

8
00:15.040 --> 00:16.880
you should be helping your brother.

9
00:17.120 --> 00:18.480
What happened to P'Phet?

10
00:18.520 --> 00:20.440
Quit Araya Group right now.

11
00:20.640 --> 00:21.960
Thanks so much

12
00:21.960 --> 00:24.200
for giving me all the love that wasn't even real.

13
00:24.800 --> 00:26.840
From now on,

14
00:27.160 --> 00:28.280
we're over.

15
00:28.280 --> 00:29.560
P'Ing, wait...

16
00:29.560 --> 00:31.800
-We can't end things like this. -Dammit.

17
00:31.800 --> 00:33.120
Once this is settled,

18
00:33.560 --> 00:35.040
I'll come back to you.

19
00:41.400 --> 00:43.120
Financial interests?

20
00:45.640 --> 00:47.840
I was actually hoping there would be some.

21
00:50.280 --> 00:51.760
But the truth is,

22
00:52.400 --> 00:54.360
he wouldn't even let me treat him to a meal.

23
00:55.120 --> 00:57.080
My secretary got him a cup of coffee,

24
00:57.080 --> 00:58.320
but he wouldn't even accept it.

25
00:59.000 --> 01:00.920
He's an incredibly upright person.

26
01:02.080 --> 01:04.080
You seem to be defending him now.

27
01:05.120 --> 01:06.560
You think I'm defending him?

28
01:07.200 --> 01:09.039
Truthfully, I find him rather annoying.

29
01:09.440 --> 01:11.280
He's made my job much harder.

30
01:11.520 --> 01:13.560
When I saw the news,

31
01:13.840 --> 01:15.440
I could hardly believe it was him.

32
01:17.560 --> 01:19.440
What's his angle here?

33
01:20.400 --> 01:21.360
Or...

34
01:22.160 --> 01:23.760
did we just have it all wrong?

35
01:26.480 --> 01:27.440
What was that sound?

36
01:28.880 --> 01:29.960
I'm really sorry,

37
01:30.520 --> 01:32.160
but I have a meeting.

38
01:33.240 --> 01:34.800
If you need any evidence

39
01:34.840 --> 01:36.520
or anything else,

40
01:36.520 --> 01:38.400
we are more than happy to help.

41
01:41.039 --> 01:41.640
Okay.

42
01:42.120 --> 01:44.200
Thank you, Mr. Tiwakorn,

43
01:44.200 --> 01:45.000
for being so cooperative.

44
01:45.039 --> 01:45.720
Thank you, too.

45
01:45.880 --> 01:47.400
-Thank you. -Thank you.

46
01:47.440 --> 01:48.120
My pleasure. Thank you.

47
02:06.000 --> 02:07.200
Let's go, Mr. Ing.

48
02:08.800 --> 02:09.320
Yeah.

49
04:29.440 --> 04:31.720
If it's not Ing, then who is it?

50
04:32.680 --> 04:33.600
I think...

51
04:34.640 --> 04:35.880
someone must have realized

52
04:35.920 --> 04:37.040
that we'd suspect him,

53
04:37.760 --> 04:39.640
so they tried to play us against each other.

54
04:42.320 --> 04:43.520
Dad, P'Phet,

55
04:44.040 --> 04:45.240
you can leave without me.

56
04:45.400 --> 04:46.840
I think I've figured something out.

57
04:47.159 --> 04:48.240
I'm going to go check it out.

58
04:55.720 --> 04:58.640
-Cheers. -May only good things come our way.

59
04:58.680 --> 05:01.360
-Nothing but good news. -Good things are coming.

60
05:04.680 --> 05:05.440
Ing,

61
05:06.160 --> 05:08.560
how's the Pattaya project coming along?

62
05:08.760 --> 05:10.880
Whether our dividends increase

63
05:10.880 --> 05:12.720
depends on how this project goes, doesn't it?

64
05:13.120 --> 05:13.800
Right.

65
05:14.040 --> 05:14.680
So?

66
05:15.560 --> 05:16.320
Yeah.

67
05:16.720 --> 05:18.880
Hey, we can trust him.

68
05:19.120 --> 05:20.280
There's nothing to worry about.

69
05:20.600 --> 05:21.120
Yeah.

70
05:21.520 --> 05:24.280
Exactly, you've always been the best.

71
05:24.600 --> 05:25.600
Let's drink.

72
05:26.280 --> 05:28.560
-Come on, drink up. -Alright.

73
05:34.560 --> 05:35.720
I'll be right back.

74
05:35.760 --> 05:36.760
Well, let's continue.

75
05:37.680 --> 05:38.840
-Come on. -Have a seat.

76
05:38.880 --> 05:39.960
Come here, sweetie.

77
05:40.280 --> 05:41.159
-Let's drink. -Come on.

78
05:41.200 --> 05:42.840
-Come on. -This is good.

79
05:43.440 --> 05:44.320
P'Ing,

80
05:45.280 --> 05:47.080
these oranges from Chiang Mai are really sweet.

81
05:49.440 --> 05:50.960
Is this how you apologize?

82
05:52.159 --> 05:52.840
Yes.

83
05:53.920 --> 05:54.560
I'm sorry,

84
05:54.600 --> 05:56.159
and I'm also begging for my life.

85
05:58.360 --> 05:59.800
Please don't take revenge on me.

86
06:01.720 --> 06:03.040
I'm terrified.

87
06:07.720 --> 06:08.720
Are you messing with me?

88
06:09.760 --> 06:10.560
No.

89
06:12.000 --> 06:13.120
Would you like to try some?

90
06:21.560 --> 06:23.680
Happy New Year.

91
06:23.680 --> 06:25.280
Ing, where are you going?

92
06:25.560 --> 06:27.480
All the relatives are here together.

93
06:28.360 --> 06:29.320
I'm visiting Grandpa.

94
06:29.680 --> 06:31.280
Please, make yourselves at home.

95
06:32.040 --> 06:32.840
Oh,

96
06:33.560 --> 06:35.560
but I guess you already have.

97
06:41.760 --> 06:43.600
-Come on. -Alright, everyone.

98
06:43.640 --> 06:44.360
Let's drink.

99
06:44.720 --> 06:45.760
Come on.

100
06:53.080 --> 06:54.440
This is Itt's Wi-Fi name.

101
06:54.720 --> 06:55.960
Try using this IP address.

102
06:58.280 --> 06:59.840
His laptop is completely clean.

103
07:03.640 --> 07:05.600
P'Phu, look for the browsing history

104
07:05.840 --> 07:07.960
and the logins to foreign websites

105
07:08.480 --> 07:09.400
that were deleted.

106
07:09.400 --> 07:10.440
Can you find them?

107
07:10.680 --> 07:11.960
Let me give it a try.

108
07:13.280 --> 07:15.360
There was a record of access to the dark web.

109
07:16.200 --> 07:17.560
It really was deleted.

110
07:22.760 --> 07:23.760
Found it.

111
07:24.240 --> 07:26.520
The transfer records are all tied to this one person.

112
07:26.560 --> 07:27.600
It really is this person.

113
07:27.640 --> 07:28.280
[Prepare the documents as agreed]

114
07:28.320 --> 07:28.960
[and transfer the money accordingly.]

115
07:31.520 --> 07:32.640
It was him all along.

116
07:48.960 --> 07:50.240
Oh, Yok?

117
07:50.840 --> 07:52.440
You should've told me you were coming this late.

118
07:52.440 --> 07:53.760
I would've saved some food for you.

119
07:55.240 --> 07:56.480
It was you who framed P'Phet,

120
07:56.720 --> 07:57.880
wasn't it?

121
07:59.720 --> 08:01.520
Yok, what the hell is wrong with you?

122
08:03.520 --> 08:05.000
That offshore account

123
08:05.200 --> 08:06.920
and the triple-encrypted money transfers...

124
08:07.480 --> 08:08.800
I've traced them all.

125
08:10.200 --> 08:11.440
Stop this, Itt.

126
08:14.600 --> 08:16.760
You once told me you couldn't read me.

127
08:17.040 --> 08:18.680
Well, now I can't read you, either.

128
08:21.160 --> 08:22.560
Why did you frame my brother, Itt?

129
08:23.720 --> 08:25.760
Are you even the same Itt I used to know?

130
08:29.240 --> 08:30.120
What are you talking about?

131
08:30.360 --> 08:31.440
I don't understand.

132
08:35.600 --> 08:36.480
Where is P'Ing?

133
08:39.400 --> 08:40.640
Why are you asking for him?

134
08:40.960 --> 08:43.520
It's New Year's. He must be home.

135
08:46.160 --> 08:46.960
He's not here.

136
08:48.800 --> 08:49.760
And where is he?

137
08:50.480 --> 08:51.960
You know what he's like.

138
08:52.800 --> 08:54.680
Who'd dare meddle with where he goes or what he does?

139
08:55.160 --> 08:57.280
Itt, who is it?

140
08:57.600 --> 08:58.520
Oh, Yok?

141
08:58.800 --> 09:00.160
What brings you here so late?

142
09:00.200 --> 09:01.240
Are you here to see Itt?

143
09:01.720 --> 09:03.480
I need to speak with P'Ing about something urgent.

144
09:05.840 --> 09:06.760
Ing?

145
09:07.240 --> 09:08.160
He isn't here.

146
09:08.960 --> 09:10.640
He left for Grandpa's a while ago.

147
09:11.960 --> 09:12.960
Thank you, ma'am.

148
09:24.680 --> 09:25.840
Just stop, Itt.

149
09:26.720 --> 09:28.560
Don't make things any worse.

150
09:32.960 --> 09:34.960
Why did Yok say those things to you?

151
09:37.360 --> 09:39.280
Oh, it's nothing, Mom.

152
09:39.560 --> 09:40.800
You should go inside.

153
09:40.840 --> 09:42.040
I'll be right behind you.

154
09:44.760 --> 09:45.760
-Okay. -Go on.

155
10:02.800 --> 10:04.200
Thanks, P'Phu.

156
10:04.320 --> 10:05.720
I've got something else to take care of.

157
10:05.720 --> 10:06.520
Please excuse me.

158
10:06.560 --> 10:07.520
No problem.

159
10:07.560 --> 10:08.920
Happy New Year.

160
10:09.440 --> 10:10.320
Thank you.

161
10:21.240 --> 10:22.200
Hello, P'Phet.

162
10:22.480 --> 10:23.760
Any updates?

163
10:24.400 --> 10:26.320
Itt is behind all of this.

164
10:27.600 --> 10:29.560
P'Phu will send you the evidence right away.

165
10:30.240 --> 10:31.400
I've already confronted him.

166
10:31.440 --> 10:32.920
I think he'll back off now,

167
10:33.760 --> 10:34.560
but if the investigation

168
10:34.560 --> 10:36.080
hasn't been dropped in a few days,

169
10:36.520 --> 10:38.360
we'll hand the evidence over to the authorities.

170
10:38.720 --> 10:40.040
Was it really Itt all along?

171
10:40.040 --> 10:42.560
The Adularaya family is quite a tangled mess.

172
10:43.160 --> 10:45.080
Are you coming home now?

173
10:45.120 --> 10:46.680
I still have something to take care of.

174
10:46.800 --> 10:47.640
What is it?

175
10:47.800 --> 10:49.240
Itt and I...

176
10:50.680 --> 10:52.960
actually took over the Pattaya project.

177
10:53.200 --> 10:53.880
What?

178
10:53.920 --> 10:54.880
Why?

179
10:55.080 --> 10:56.360
It's a long story.

180
10:57.600 --> 10:58.160
I never meant

181
10:58.160 --> 10:59.960
to drag you into this mess.

182
11:00.520 --> 11:01.480
I'm sorry.

183
11:02.200 --> 11:04.640
So, that something you have to take care of,

184
11:04.680 --> 11:05.840
what is it?

185
11:06.800 --> 11:08.160
I'm going to see P'Ing

186
11:08.200 --> 11:09.560
and apologize to him.

187
11:10.640 --> 11:12.240
Go on, and be careful.

188
11:12.360 --> 11:13.480
Don't worry about things here.

189
11:32.400 --> 11:33.080
Oh?

190
11:34.360 --> 11:35.280
Yok?

191
11:35.960 --> 11:36.720
Grandpa,

192
11:37.320 --> 11:38.200
is P'Ing here?

193
11:39.840 --> 11:40.520
Ing?

194
11:42.400 --> 11:43.440
He just dropped some things off

195
11:43.480 --> 11:44.880
and stayed for a bit,

196
11:45.080 --> 11:46.200
and then he left.

197
11:47.520 --> 11:49.200
Did he tell you where he was heading?

198
11:50.440 --> 11:51.480
He mentioned...

199
11:52.000 --> 11:54.160
he had to sort out something about...

200
11:54.160 --> 11:56.000
the Phuket project or whatever it's called.

201
11:58.000 --> 11:59.200
Phuket?

202
12:01.080 --> 12:03.240
Well, Grandpa, I have something to take care of.

203
12:03.280 --> 12:04.560
I'll take my leave now.

204
12:10.480 --> 12:11.960
Kids these days...

205
12:14.040 --> 12:15.880
They come whenever they feel like it

206
12:16.160 --> 12:18.000
and leave whenever they want.

207
12:56.280 --> 12:57.400
[Phuket Land Purchase Agreement]

208
12:57.440 --> 12:58.720
[Tiwakorn Adularaya]

209
13:00.360 --> 13:01.160
Everything is ready.

210
13:02.840 --> 13:03.800
Thank you very much.

211
13:03.800 --> 13:04.640
Thank you.

212
13:12.280 --> 13:13.280
Secretary Piang,

213
13:14.600 --> 13:16.080
transfer the funds immediately.

214
13:16.120 --> 13:18.400
Let's welcome this great project

215
13:18.400 --> 13:19.440
for the New Year.

216
13:20.480 --> 13:21.760
As for me,

217
13:22.560 --> 13:23.720
I'm going to bed.

218
13:23.720 --> 13:25.120
I woke up way too early.

219
13:25.160 --> 13:26.800
Understood. I'll get right on it.

220
13:54.720 --> 13:58.560
P'Ing, where are you?

221
14:25.640 --> 14:29.440
[Secretary Piang]

222
14:36.360 --> 14:37.240
Hello?

223
14:37.480 --> 14:38.400
Mr. Ing,

224
14:38.400 --> 14:40.640
the land in Phuket has been seized by court order.

225
14:41.080 --> 14:42.440
Accounting just completed the transfer,

226
14:42.480 --> 14:43.760
so our funds

227
14:43.800 --> 14:46.200
have been frozen as well.

228
15:13.760 --> 15:14.440
P'Yot...

229
15:15.000 --> 15:16.520
I was just about to call you.

230
15:16.720 --> 15:18.120
Is it about the land in Phuket?

231
15:18.160 --> 15:19.040
You already know?

232
15:19.400 --> 15:20.320
I just found out.

233
15:20.360 --> 15:22.200
The company selling us this land

234
15:22.240 --> 15:24.320
concealed its outstanding debts.

235
15:24.480 --> 15:25.480
How were we supposed to know?

236
15:25.680 --> 15:27.240
The moment we signed the contract,

237
15:27.320 --> 15:28.560
the creditor company

238
15:28.560 --> 15:29.880
suddenly showed up.

239
15:29.920 --> 15:31.360
Who's taking responsibility for this?

240
15:32.200 --> 15:33.720
And what happened to that company?

241
15:34.000 --> 15:35.640
The current management had taken over the company

242
15:35.840 --> 15:38.480
and knew nothing about the old debts.

243
15:38.640 --> 15:40.840
They only found out when the creditors came knocking.

244
15:41.480 --> 15:42.280
They're demanding...

245
15:42.280 --> 15:43.240
two billion baht.

246
15:43.840 --> 15:44.880
Two billion?

247
15:45.600 --> 15:46.440
Hey, P'Yot.

248
15:47.040 --> 15:48.440
This is a very big deal.

249
15:48.440 --> 15:49.760
You really had no idea?

250
15:49.760 --> 15:50.640
Ing,

251
15:50.640 --> 15:53.600
if I knew, I'd have skipped town already.

252
15:53.920 --> 15:55.720
I wouldn't be here talking to you.

253
15:56.040 --> 15:56.560
Okay.

254
15:56.600 --> 15:58.080
I'm sorry, P'Yot. I...

255
15:59.600 --> 16:00.680
I'm just overwhelmed.

256
16:00.760 --> 16:01.840
I get it.

257
16:01.840 --> 16:04.760
Anyone would be frantic in a situation like this.

258
16:04.880 --> 16:05.800
Let's talk.

259
16:05.840 --> 16:07.680
We need to figure out how to fix this.

260
16:07.680 --> 16:09.160
I'll do everything I can.

261
16:11.440 --> 16:12.200
P'Yot,

262
16:12.760 --> 16:13.600
let's talk later.

263
16:13.640 --> 16:14.880
I've got something to do.

264
16:14.920 --> 16:15.960
I'll reschedule with you.

265
16:18.280 --> 16:19.280
Mr. Ing...

266
16:21.600 --> 16:22.960
The landowner's creditors...

267
16:22.960 --> 16:24.320
have requested a meeting right now.

268
16:25.760 --> 16:26.680
They're here?

269
16:26.720 --> 16:27.840
Already?

270
16:27.840 --> 16:28.560
Yes.

271
16:28.920 --> 16:30.240
They've requested that you go alone

272
16:30.280 --> 16:31.520
and not bring Mr. Yot.

273
16:40.000 --> 16:40.800
Dammit.

274
16:40.840 --> 16:42.640
Talk about perfect timing.

275
16:45.440 --> 16:47.360
The moment I hung up, they showed up.

276
16:47.440 --> 16:49.240
Who is pulling the strings here?

277
16:53.520 --> 16:54.560
Excuse me.

278
17:13.440 --> 17:14.400
Secretary Piang,

279
17:15.839 --> 17:17.040
you can leave.

280
17:18.680 --> 17:20.040
I can handle this.

281
17:40.720 --> 17:41.520
Hi, P'Ing.

282
17:42.080 --> 17:43.440
It's been a long time.

283
17:45.320 --> 17:46.320
How have you been?

284
18:08.040 --> 18:10.120
You've gotten pretty good at this, haven't you?

285
18:10.760 --> 18:12.640
I didn't let you down, did I?

286
18:16.840 --> 18:17.960
What the hell are you doing, Itt?

287
18:20.200 --> 18:22.080
You said we were here to talk business with him.

288
18:26.120 --> 18:27.120
[Notice of Penalty Fine]

289
18:27.160 --> 18:28.200
[Araya Group Co., Ltd.]

290
18:28.240 --> 18:29.560
[Penalty Amount: Two billion baht only]

291
18:32.160 --> 18:33.200
Two billion?

292
18:33.520 --> 18:34.800
Have you lost your mind?

293
18:36.120 --> 18:36.840
Yok,

294
18:37.600 --> 18:39.120
you should be happy.

295
18:40.560 --> 18:42.840
After all, you have a share in this, too.

296
18:43.480 --> 18:45.120
I backed out a long time ago.

297
18:45.320 --> 18:47.440
So you've been lying to both him and me?

298
18:47.800 --> 18:48.360
Hey.

299
18:49.920 --> 18:51.600
If you are going to put on a show,

300
18:51.640 --> 18:53.440
could you do it somewhere else?

301
18:54.120 --> 18:55.960
You're wasting my damn time.

302
18:59.000 --> 18:59.760
P'Ing,

303
19:00.600 --> 19:01.960
I didn't know anything about this.

304
19:04.360 --> 19:05.360
Who do you think you are?

305
19:06.240 --> 19:08.200
What right do you have to touch me?

306
19:09.400 --> 19:10.640
-Let go. -P'Ing...

307
19:12.280 --> 19:13.960
I said, let go.

308
19:17.760 --> 19:19.680
I don't care what you two are fighting about.

309
19:19.720 --> 19:21.640
The only person I care about is that jerk.

310
19:22.120 --> 19:24.000
As for you, get the hell out.

311
19:30.440 --> 19:31.800
I'll be waiting outside.

312
19:55.360 --> 19:56.280
Impressive.

313
20:01.160 --> 20:04.120
You spent all this time pretending to be a fool

314
20:04.520 --> 20:06.480
and letting me walk all over you.

315
20:07.840 --> 20:09.200
I have to hand it to you.

316
20:13.520 --> 20:15.200
Just tell me what you want.

317
20:19.160 --> 20:20.320
Aren't you mad at me?

318
20:24.520 --> 20:26.040
Just say what you have to say.

319
20:35.400 --> 20:36.680
I just want half the shares

320
20:36.720 --> 20:37.720
in Araya Group.

321
20:45.240 --> 20:46.680
Do you think your leverage

322
20:46.680 --> 20:49.160
is worth half of my company?

323
20:49.560 --> 20:52.160
Well, it's enough to put Araya Group at a loss

324
20:52.600 --> 20:54.520
and leave it billions in debt.

325
20:56.320 --> 20:58.360
But Araya Group doesn't belong only to me.

326
20:59.720 --> 21:01.080
With what you're doing,

327
21:01.080 --> 21:03.440
do you think our relatives will just sit back and watch?

328
21:04.640 --> 21:05.560
I don't care.

329
21:07.200 --> 21:08.320
Aside from Dad,

330
21:09.440 --> 21:11.440
everyone else is on your side anyway, aren't they?

331
21:13.760 --> 21:15.160
Even if you all lose everything and go bust,

332
21:16.160 --> 21:17.320
I'll just laugh in your faces.

333
21:20.080 --> 21:22.080
And do you really think that...

334
21:24.360 --> 21:27.080
I'd be afraid of my company going bust?

335
21:28.440 --> 21:29.520
What a pity.

336
21:30.520 --> 21:33.000
After all those meals at my house,

337
21:33.040 --> 21:35.240
not a single brain cell of yours has gotten any smarter.

338
21:36.160 --> 21:37.760
What makes you think

339
21:38.320 --> 21:40.320
I'd ever submit to you? You idiot.

340
21:40.320 --> 21:41.680
Do you really think...

341
21:43.120 --> 21:44.800
I'd ever let you boss me around?

342
21:46.760 --> 21:47.520
Listen.

343
21:49.120 --> 21:50.440
I'd rather...

344
21:52.560 --> 21:53.360
go down in flames

345
21:53.400 --> 21:54.920
than ever submit to you.

346
21:56.320 --> 21:57.800
Don't think your pathetic little scheme

347
21:57.840 --> 21:59.040
can bring me down.

348
21:59.440 --> 22:00.840
This is just the appetizer.

349
22:01.320 --> 22:02.760
The real show starts now.

350
22:03.640 --> 22:05.640
I'm going to ruin you.

351
22:21.040 --> 22:21.840
P'Ing...

352
22:23.880 --> 22:25.760
You've made my life a living hell for so long.

353
22:35.680 --> 22:37.280
P'Ing, hey...

354
22:37.320 --> 22:39.200
I didn't know anything about the Phuket project.

355
22:39.840 --> 22:41.000
Please hear me out.

356
22:41.720 --> 22:43.360
He's been playing us this whole time.

357
22:43.680 --> 22:45.600
It's not just the Pattaya and Phuket projects.

358
22:46.080 --> 22:48.520
He was the one who framed P'Phet, too.

359
22:48.600 --> 22:50.120
That's why I misunderstood everything.

360
22:51.920 --> 22:52.560
Yeah?

361
22:53.640 --> 22:56.200
P'Ing, I really want to help you.

362
22:59.560 --> 23:01.520
So you think being lied to...

363
23:03.760 --> 23:05.680
makes you some poor, helpless victim?

364
23:06.800 --> 23:08.000
That's not what I meant.

365
23:08.400 --> 23:09.160
P'Ing...

366
23:09.560 --> 23:11.040
When you decided to back out,

367
23:12.560 --> 23:14.320
why didn't you tell me right away?

368
23:16.280 --> 23:17.040
I never thought

369
23:17.080 --> 23:18.440
he'd go this far.

370
23:18.960 --> 23:19.800
I was just afraid that

371
23:19.840 --> 23:21.120
if you knew the truth,

372
23:21.400 --> 23:23.040
you'd never talk to me again.

373
23:26.920 --> 23:28.960
I thought you were just a scumbag,

374
23:30.720 --> 23:31.600
but now...

375
23:32.000 --> 23:34.240
I've realized you're also incredibly stupid.

376
23:36.880 --> 23:37.640
You're right.

377
23:38.160 --> 23:38.840
Fine,

378
23:40.640 --> 23:41.760
I'll believe you

379
23:41.760 --> 23:43.120
that you're Itt's victim, too.

380
23:44.800 --> 23:46.560
After all, using debt as leverage

381
23:47.560 --> 23:50.280
to force me to give up my shares

382
23:50.320 --> 23:51.640
isn't how you operate.

383
23:54.440 --> 23:55.160
Shares?

384
23:57.560 --> 23:58.920
He's making you give up your shares?

385
23:59.440 --> 24:00.160
Yeah.

386
24:01.720 --> 24:03.520
This kind of dirty tactic

387
24:03.560 --> 24:05.680
is beneath someone as conceited as you.

388
24:06.160 --> 24:06.840
Oh...

389
24:08.120 --> 24:09.000
I see.

390
24:10.880 --> 24:13.720
You probably think Itt's the poor victim here,

391
24:14.120 --> 24:15.440
while I'm just...

392
24:15.800 --> 24:17.360
some tyrant who abuses his power

393
24:17.760 --> 24:19.240
and pushes everyone around.

394
24:21.800 --> 24:22.880
So I guess...

395
24:22.920 --> 24:24.280
I got what I deserved.

396
24:26.080 --> 24:28.040
P'Ing, that's not what I'm thinking.

397
24:28.960 --> 24:31.040
Oh, it's not?

398
24:32.960 --> 24:33.960
Then what are you thinking?

399
24:36.680 --> 24:38.840
And yet you still had the nerve to suspect me

400
24:39.960 --> 24:41.600
of setting your brother up.

401
24:42.720 --> 24:45.400
♪ We don't fit on your canvas ♪

402
24:45.400 --> 24:48.880
♪ We burn it all to ashes now ♪

403
24:50.600 --> 24:51.880
You lied to me.

404
24:54.480 --> 24:55.600
You used me.

405
24:56.800 --> 24:58.120
And then you suspected me.

406
25:03.280 --> 25:04.560
Let me ask you something.

407
25:07.120 --> 25:08.520
Do you really think

408
25:09.440 --> 25:11.240
we could ever go back to the way we were?

409
25:16.320 --> 25:18.920
I've made myself perfectly clear.

410
25:21.000 --> 25:22.240
You should know where you stand.

411
25:44.600 --> 25:45.400
Let go.

412
25:46.360 --> 25:47.200
P'Ing...

413
25:49.720 --> 25:51.040
Let go of me.

414
26:26.240 --> 26:27.880
Dammit.

415
26:46.480 --> 26:47.720
Hello, Manager.

416
26:48.520 --> 26:50.440
I'm sorry to call you on a day off.

417
26:52.440 --> 26:53.440
Are you free right now?

418
26:54.960 --> 26:56.080
I'd like to discuss

419
26:56.080 --> 26:57.880
the loan for the Phuket project.

420
27:00.720 --> 27:01.560
Thank you so much.

421
27:02.240 --> 27:03.080
I'll see you then.

422
27:17.680 --> 27:19.040
Stay strong, Ing.

423
27:21.040 --> 27:21.840
Save your strength

424
27:21.880 --> 27:24.360
to tear those two brats apart.

425
27:27.520 --> 27:29.720
Leo, book a VIP room for me

426
27:29.760 --> 27:31.040
and have some good liquor ready.

427
27:41.240 --> 27:41.920
Dad.

428
27:41.960 --> 27:43.560
Oh, Itt. You're here?

429
27:43.560 --> 27:44.320
Yes.

430
27:44.360 --> 27:45.920
I wanted to ask you something

431
27:46.200 --> 27:47.440
about the Phuket project.

432
27:47.520 --> 27:48.680
How is it going?

433
27:49.040 --> 27:50.720
I heard rumors from the board

434
27:50.760 --> 27:53.200
that your brother got scammed big time.

435
27:53.480 --> 27:54.960
He's likely to face massive losses.

436
27:55.760 --> 27:56.280
Yes.

437
27:56.640 --> 27:58.600
Things really aren't looking good.

438
27:59.800 --> 28:01.240
It's true we got the land,

439
28:01.440 --> 28:03.040
but it came with a lot of debt.

440
28:03.360 --> 28:04.400
And now...

441
28:05.120 --> 28:07.120
the creditors are demanding that he pay them

442
28:07.760 --> 28:08.960
two billion.

443
28:08.960 --> 28:11.000
What? Two billion?

444
28:12.360 --> 28:13.760
Did Ing tell you this?

445
28:15.120 --> 28:15.920
No.

446
28:16.200 --> 28:18.440
I knew about this even before he did

447
28:19.920 --> 28:21.320
because one of his creditors...

448
28:22.360 --> 28:23.440
is me.

449
28:30.800 --> 28:33.160
But I have no use for that much money,

450
28:33.600 --> 28:34.320
so I told him to hand over

451
28:34.360 --> 28:36.200
half of the company's shares instead.

452
28:38.560 --> 28:39.320
You...

453
28:42.080 --> 28:43.440
Itt, how dare you?

454
28:51.960 --> 28:53.080
Why are you so mad?

455
28:53.880 --> 28:55.400
Even if he transfers the shares to me,

456
28:56.000 --> 28:56.760
Araya Group

457
28:56.760 --> 28:58.480
still stays within the Adularaya family.

458
28:58.520 --> 28:59.880
You ungrateful son.

459
28:59.920 --> 29:01.080
You absolute scoundrel.

460
29:01.080 --> 29:02.800
If you still see me as your dad,

461
29:03.080 --> 29:04.840
stop this madness right now

462
29:05.440 --> 29:06.960
and apologize to your brother.

463
29:08.640 --> 29:10.440
You kept telling me how much you love and pity me,

464
29:10.480 --> 29:12.600
but in the end, you're still taking his side.

465
29:14.720 --> 29:16.560
This is about doing what's right.

466
29:16.880 --> 29:18.280
I'm your dad.

467
29:18.320 --> 29:20.080
I can't just let you do terrible things like this.

468
29:20.520 --> 29:22.040
Put an end to all of this.

469
29:25.320 --> 29:26.760
What if I don't want to?

470
29:28.960 --> 29:29.880
You...

471
29:30.280 --> 29:31.120
Itt.

472
29:38.600 --> 29:40.200
You ungrateful son.

473
29:40.480 --> 29:41.800
He's your brother.

474
29:41.840 --> 29:43.120
How could you do this?

475
29:43.120 --> 29:44.480
Honey, don't hit him.

476
29:45.040 --> 29:46.040
I'm teaching him a lesson.

477
29:46.080 --> 29:47.160
This has nothing to do with you.

478
29:47.280 --> 29:49.400
If you want to hit him, hit me, too.

479
29:49.720 --> 29:50.560
Mom,

480
29:50.840 --> 29:52.680
if he wants to hit me, let him.

481
29:53.760 --> 29:54.560
But Dad,

482
29:55.280 --> 29:56.840
I will never back down on this.

483
29:58.320 --> 29:59.920
You two...

484
30:00.200 --> 30:02.840
have been manipulating me with your tears all this time.

485
30:05.600 --> 30:06.760
Get out of my face.

486
30:08.080 --> 30:09.200
Get out of my house.

487
30:13.400 --> 30:14.440
Come on.

488
30:14.960 --> 30:15.840
Let's go.

489
30:18.560 --> 30:19.800
How could this happen?

490
30:25.600 --> 30:26.600
How could you make such a big decision

491
30:26.640 --> 30:28.320
without talking to me first?

492
30:28.640 --> 30:29.520
You can't spring it on him like that.

493
30:29.560 --> 30:31.600
Are you trying to give your dad a heart attack?

494
30:32.680 --> 30:33.760
This "dad" you're talking about...

495
30:34.000 --> 30:35.080
Which one do you mean?

496
30:56.920 --> 31:01.560
♪ The red sun rose this morning ♪

497
31:02.240 --> 31:06.840
♪ Dark skies pronounce your warning ♪

498
31:07.600 --> 31:10.120
♪ Nowhere to run ♪

499
31:10.680 --> 31:11.360
Hello?

500
31:11.920 --> 31:12.640
Where are you?

501
31:14.160 --> 31:15.080
What's up?

502
31:15.320 --> 31:16.840
Send me your location. I'll pick you up.

503
31:18.080 --> 31:23.000
♪ Hold on, the floor is caving ♪

504
31:23.160 --> 31:27.800
♪ Your walls turn into cages ♪

505
31:40.160 --> 31:40.880
Hey.

506
31:42.600 --> 31:43.680
Are you sure

507
31:43.720 --> 31:45.360
I don't need accident insurance before doing this?

508
32:06.800 --> 32:08.080
If you don't say anything,

509
32:09.920 --> 32:11.640
I won't know what you want.

510
32:48.640 --> 32:49.360
Ouch.

511
32:57.880 --> 32:58.880
Who did this to you?

512
33:00.800 --> 33:01.680
You belong to me.

513
33:02.520 --> 33:03.640
You belong to me.

514
33:20.760 --> 33:23.120
Yeah, I'm yours.

515
33:27.720 --> 33:28.720
It's okay.

516
33:29.600 --> 33:30.920
I'll help you.

517
33:44.840 --> 33:47.120
Hey, I told you to open the door.

518
33:47.320 --> 33:49.320
Can't you hear me?

519
33:50.000 --> 33:51.560
-Hey. -Yes. Coming.

520
33:51.560 --> 33:53.080
Dammit, no one can do anything right.

521
33:53.120 --> 33:54.000
Hurry up.

522
33:54.520 --> 33:55.280
Come on in.

523
33:55.320 --> 33:56.040
Dammit.

524
34:01.400 --> 34:02.240
What were you doing?

525
34:02.280 --> 34:03.520
Didn't you hear me?

526
34:04.240 --> 34:06.720
I... I was in the bathroom.

527
34:10.480 --> 34:11.239
Dammit.

528
34:28.080 --> 34:28.840
Get over here.

529
34:32.600 --> 34:33.560
Sit down.

530
34:47.480 --> 34:48.600
You're scared?

531
34:58.680 --> 34:59.840
My life...

532
35:01.960 --> 35:03.840
is freaking pathetic, isn't it?

533
35:05.880 --> 35:07.800
Full of myself, thinking I was so smart.

534
35:10.280 --> 35:11.520
And look how it turned out.

535
35:12.960 --> 35:13.920
I got stabbed in the back.

536
35:16.080 --> 35:17.240
Itt,

537
35:17.680 --> 35:18.760
Pite, those jerks...

538
35:22.960 --> 35:24.280
And even Yok...

539
35:29.880 --> 35:31.960
No one gives a damn about me.

540
35:33.400 --> 35:35.120
They only care about what they can gain from me.

541
35:44.040 --> 35:45.240
Pathetic, right?

542
37:48.520 --> 37:50.280
This is what you call a sporty look.

543
37:50.320 --> 37:51.560
Take notes, student.

544
37:51.840 --> 37:52.720
And this...

545
37:53.760 --> 37:55.920
is a nerd who has no sense of style.

546
37:59.960 --> 38:00.880
Isn't it hot?

547
38:01.440 --> 38:02.200
Shut up.

548
38:03.160 --> 38:04.560
Everything I say

549
38:04.600 --> 38:05.760
is always right.

550
38:05.880 --> 38:06.720
Remember that.

551
38:06.960 --> 38:07.880
Once you're in America,

552
38:07.880 --> 38:09.120
you have to look like a superstar boxer

553
38:09.160 --> 38:10.600
and be fashionable. Got it?

554
38:10.640 --> 38:11.640
You can't let them look down on you

555
38:11.640 --> 38:13.040
for having no sense of style.

556
38:13.280 --> 38:13.960
Okay?

557
38:21.960 --> 38:22.680
Okay.

558
38:22.840 --> 38:24.360
My fashion sense is always on point.

559
38:24.600 --> 38:26.120
No matter what look I go for,

560
38:26.440 --> 38:27.320
it's always perfect.

561
38:27.720 --> 38:29.040
Just trust me. Here.

562
38:29.880 --> 38:30.720
Wear it.

563
39:35.920 --> 39:37.440
Feeling down or not, you still need to eat.

564
39:38.760 --> 39:39.880
Want some?

565
39:42.200 --> 39:43.320
Shall we go to the usual spot?

566
39:45.120 --> 39:46.400
I was just about to say that.

567
40:06.880 --> 40:08.200
These stairs never seemed this steep

568
40:08.200 --> 40:09.640
when we were little.

569
40:10.880 --> 40:11.520
Here.

570
40:12.520 --> 40:13.320
Thanks.

571
40:17.880 --> 40:20.320
How old were we when we last came up here

572
40:20.560 --> 40:21.640
to eat noodles together?

573
40:25.200 --> 40:26.840
Probably around seven or eight.

574
40:29.920 --> 40:32.240
Instant noodles tasted so good back then

575
40:32.480 --> 40:34.040
because we couldn't let Mom know.

576
40:34.960 --> 40:37.280
Now that we can eat them whenever we want,

577
40:38.040 --> 40:39.720
they just don't seem to taste the same.

578
40:45.040 --> 40:45.840
P'Phet,

579
40:47.760 --> 40:50.360
Dad must be really mad at me.

580
40:52.320 --> 40:53.640
That's the least of it.

581
40:54.760 --> 40:56.440
He's actually worried about you.

582
41:09.040 --> 41:10.120
It's all my fault.

583
41:11.440 --> 41:13.560
I've had so much going on lately.

584
41:15.480 --> 41:16.520
Everything is a mess.

585
41:17.960 --> 41:18.960
I'm sorry.

586
41:22.120 --> 41:24.040
What's done is done. Just let it go.

587
41:26.080 --> 41:26.960
But what about Itt?

588
41:27.480 --> 41:28.640
What actually happened?

589
41:36.080 --> 41:38.440
He's been feeding me lies since we were little.

590
41:38.920 --> 41:40.880
He said Ing was always picking on him

591
41:41.200 --> 41:42.600
and hurting him.

592
41:44.400 --> 41:47.240
He said he wanted to use the Pattaya project

593
41:47.480 --> 41:49.240
as security for himself and his mom

594
41:51.000 --> 41:53.040
and as a chance to teach P'Ing a lesson,

595
41:55.400 --> 41:57.160
so I agreed to help him.

596
41:59.600 --> 42:00.440
No wonder.

597
42:01.280 --> 42:02.520
That's why you've stayed at Araya Group

598
42:02.520 --> 42:03.600
all this time.

599
42:06.280 --> 42:07.320
You know what?

600
42:11.160 --> 42:12.640
The longer I stayed,

601
42:13.960 --> 42:15.640
the more I realized P'Ing isn't a bad person.

602
42:18.280 --> 42:20.320
That's why I backed out of Itt's plan,

603
42:21.600 --> 42:23.040
but I didn't tell P'Ing about it.

604
42:25.400 --> 42:27.040
I thought it would be fine.

605
42:29.880 --> 42:31.160
But who could've known?

606
42:32.440 --> 42:33.680
Itt rigged

607
42:33.720 --> 42:35.000
another project,

608
42:35.120 --> 42:37.440
which left Araya Group two billion in debt.

609
42:38.240 --> 42:39.440
Two billion?

610
42:40.760 --> 42:41.520
Yes.

611
42:42.040 --> 42:43.040
Two billion.

612
42:45.000 --> 42:45.720
P'Phet...

613
42:49.400 --> 42:51.000
I've always thought

614
42:52.720 --> 42:53.840
that I was smart,

615
42:57.000 --> 42:58.440
but now I've realized...

616
42:59.680 --> 43:00.840
I'm a complete idiot.

617
43:02.080 --> 43:04.440
I tried explaining everything to P'Ing,

618
43:05.160 --> 43:06.640
but he wouldn't forgive me.

619
43:20.960 --> 43:22.120
Listen, Yok.

620
43:23.440 --> 43:24.960
Give him some time.

621
43:26.920 --> 43:29.320
The view from inside a room is different

622
43:29.600 --> 43:30.840
from the one up on a rooftop.

623
43:43.440 --> 43:45.000
What you need to do right now

624
43:45.400 --> 43:47.600
isn't to figure out how to make him forgive you.

625
43:51.000 --> 43:52.720
It's to figure out what he needs

626
43:53.840 --> 43:55.800
and what you can do to help him.

627
44:05.320 --> 44:05.960
Okay.

628
44:08.080 --> 44:09.920
Eat up. You need the brain food.

629
44:21.880 --> 44:22.840
I gotta go now.

630
44:24.800 --> 44:26.200
Wait until I finish.

631
44:26.240 --> 44:27.480
We can head down together.

632
44:31.080 --> 44:32.320
I'm going back to Pattaya.

633
44:33.080 --> 44:34.520
I've got work to do tomorrow.

634
44:35.800 --> 44:36.760
That's right.

635
44:37.320 --> 44:38.440
Should I drive you?

636
44:39.480 --> 44:40.440
No need.

637
44:41.480 --> 44:43.040
I'll be coming home often.

638
44:43.600 --> 44:45.560
You can come to me if you ever need anything.

639
44:49.440 --> 44:50.000
Here.

640
44:50.960 --> 44:52.240
Finish the rest for me.

641
44:53.560 --> 44:54.400
I'm off.

642
45:18.200 --> 45:19.320
[I have all the evidence of you]

643
45:19.320 --> 45:20.400
[framing and filing a complaint against P'Phet.]

644
45:20.400 --> 45:21.600
[If you don't stop this now,]

645
45:21.600 --> 45:22.960
[I'll hand everything over to the DSI.]

646
46:05.520 --> 46:07.440
I forgot to tell you. We're not having dinner at home

647
46:07.480 --> 46:09.000
this New Year's.

648
46:09.480 --> 46:11.280
How much longer will you keep this from me?

649
46:11.400 --> 46:13.320
I won't let that homewrecker

650
46:13.520 --> 46:15.520
disrespect my mom ever again.

651
46:16.080 --> 46:17.800
Please have all the necessary paperwork

652
46:17.800 --> 46:18.800
ready for me to sign.

653
46:18.920 --> 46:20.120
I'm leaving today.

654
46:20.120 --> 46:20.800
P'Piang,

655
46:20.960 --> 46:21.800
where's P'Ing?

656
46:21.960 --> 46:23.400
I've been waiting for you

657
46:23.480 --> 46:24.400
to come home.

658
46:25.360 --> 46:26.080
Who do you think you are,

659
46:26.080 --> 46:27.320
messing with my boy?

660
46:27.480 --> 46:28.960
I've got proof that Itt framed P'Phet.

